[{:db/id 17592186172094 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-924019d9-3882-5c74-a8d2-1e7c35a68ea0"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-924019d9-3882-5c74-a8d2-1e7c35a68ea0" :question/id #uuid "924019d9-3882-5c74-a8d2-1e7c35a68ea0" :question/math-academy-id "q-124260" :question/problem "The matrix form of the affine transformation\n\n$$\nx=4u+a,\\,y=6u+bv+c\n$$\n\nis shown below. What is the value of $a+b+c?$\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "An affine transformation $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ is a function of the form\n\n$$\nx=Au+b,\n$$\n\nwhere $x,u,$ and $b$ are column vectors in ${R}^{2},$ and $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nWe can carry out the matrix operations using the matrix form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}] & =\\overset{A}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2\\end{aligned}]}}\\cdot \\overset{u}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]}}+\\overset{b}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]}} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4u \\\\ 6u+2v\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4u \\\\ 6u+2v-1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding elements, we obtain\n\n$$\nx=4u+0,\\,y=6u+2v+(-1)\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=0+2+(-1)=1.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9adca1c4-5980-5cfc-b795-52fbb2b1c569"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9adca1c4-5980-5cfc-b795-52fbb2b1c569" :answer-field/id #uuid "9adca1c4-5980-5cfc-b795-52fbb2b1c569" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-66027fe1-2bba-5e05-8206-4ca92bebfb97" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7df97388-6b5d-5314-a0e2-f9db5b72c685" "answer-30e78d75-7cc9-5f8f-a311-f9561d084ef0" "answer-9e8c9a39-bea2-5dc9-ae9f-054f40df79f8" "answer-66027fe1-2bba-5e05-8206-4ca92bebfb97" "answer-5cbd50d4-87c1-52b7-9640-b711a0fd95b4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7df97388-6b5d-5314-a0e2-f9db5b72c685" :answer/id #uuid "7df97388-6b5d-5314-a0e2-f9db5b72c685" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-30e78d75-7cc9-5f8f-a311-f9561d084ef0" :answer/id #uuid "30e78d75-7cc9-5f8f-a311-f9561d084ef0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9e8c9a39-bea2-5dc9-ae9f-054f40df79f8" :answer/id #uuid "9e8c9a39-bea2-5dc9-ae9f-054f40df79f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-66027fe1-2bba-5e05-8206-4ca92bebfb97" :answer/id #uuid "66027fe1-2bba-5e05-8206-4ca92bebfb97" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5cbd50d4-87c1-52b7-9640-b711a0fd95b4" :answer/id #uuid "5cbd50d4-87c1-52b7-9640-b711a0fd95b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186172093 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-0f1617b1-29a0-58b4-80d3-cf8ca8d2090f" "question-abc616ba-5b7e-5285-91c7-65fdcb2a91f9"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-0f1617b1-29a0-58b4-80d3-cf8ca8d2090f" :question/id #uuid "0f1617b1-29a0-58b4-80d3-cf8ca8d2090f" :question/math-academy-id "q-124288" :question/problem "The matrix form of the affine transformation\n\n$$\nx=2u+5v,\\,y=u-3v\n$$\n\nis shown below. What is the value of $a+b+c?$\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 5 \\\\ a & b\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ c\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "An affine transformation $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ is a function of the form\n\n$$\nx=Au+b,\n$$\n\nwhere $x,u,$ and $b$ are column vectors in ${R}^{2},$ and $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nFirst, notice that we can express the given transformation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2u+5v \\\\ u-3v\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSeparating the constants and expressing the linear part as a product, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}2u+5v \\\\ u-3v\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2u+5v \\\\ u-3v\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}2 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{A}\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{u}+{{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{b}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=1+(-3)+0=-2.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-29e8d3c2-d32c-5baa-954b-7b5d1efc7457"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-29e8d3c2-d32c-5baa-954b-7b5d1efc7457" :answer-field/id #uuid "29e8d3c2-d32c-5baa-954b-7b5d1efc7457" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b2f12e59-3811-5fbe-a8bd-eda4370e2e83" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d78bfad4-b673-5a93-bb2a-0e0334cd3321" "answer-b2f12e59-3811-5fbe-a8bd-eda4370e2e83" "answer-99696a64-81b6-56b3-ae94-3cf2f2bf032d" "answer-87c225a4-fa6b-5ff4-a3be-9440301a14e4" "answer-c4beb685-88bd-5864-8597-0ef45eddb0b6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d78bfad4-b673-5a93-bb2a-0e0334cd3321" :answer/id #uuid "d78bfad4-b673-5a93-bb2a-0e0334cd3321" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b2f12e59-3811-5fbe-a8bd-eda4370e2e83" :answer/id #uuid "b2f12e59-3811-5fbe-a8bd-eda4370e2e83" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-99696a64-81b6-56b3-ae94-3cf2f2bf032d" :answer/id #uuid "99696a64-81b6-56b3-ae94-3cf2f2bf032d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-87c225a4-fa6b-5ff4-a3be-9440301a14e4" :answer/id #uuid "87c225a4-fa6b-5ff4-a3be-9440301a14e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c4beb685-88bd-5864-8597-0ef45eddb0b6" :answer/id #uuid "c4beb685-88bd-5864-8597-0ef45eddb0b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-abc616ba-5b7e-5285-91c7-65fdcb2a91f9" :question/id #uuid "abc616ba-5b7e-5285-91c7-65fdcb2a91f9" :question/math-academy-id "q-124299" :question/problem "The matrix form of the affine transformation\n\n$$\nx=v-7u,\\,y=2v-u\n$$\n\nis shown below. What is the value of $a+b+c?$\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}a & 1 \\\\ -1 & b\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}c \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "An affine transformation $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ is a function of the form\n\n$$\nx=Au+b,\n$$\n\nwhere $x,u,$ and $b$ are column vectors in ${R}^{2},$ and $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nFirst, notice that we can express the given transformation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}v-7u \\\\ 2v-u\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSeparating the constants and expressing the linear part as a product, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}v-7u \\\\ 2v-u\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-7u+v \\\\ -u+2v\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}-7 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{A}\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{u}+{{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{b}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=-7+2+0=-5.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8859ffa2-d430-5120-8081-1bbcdaf58a41"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8859ffa2-d430-5120-8081-1bbcdaf58a41" :answer-field/id #uuid "8859ffa2-d430-5120-8081-1bbcdaf58a41" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-606c1e22-4819-56b5-82a2-48e43550b035" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d60c5735-4076-5c3e-b98e-aa72880ddf6c" "answer-606c1e22-4819-56b5-82a2-48e43550b035" "answer-eeb2f54f-b084-5556-a569-1423fbe14b78" "answer-5023974e-65e9-50b5-9103-6472584bc9df" "answer-88148730-01ef-5f8f-8698-d5c0f9002897"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d60c5735-4076-5c3e-b98e-aa72880ddf6c" :answer/id #uuid "d60c5735-4076-5c3e-b98e-aa72880ddf6c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-606c1e22-4819-56b5-82a2-48e43550b035" :answer/id #uuid "606c1e22-4819-56b5-82a2-48e43550b035" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-eeb2f54f-b084-5556-a569-1423fbe14b78" :answer/id #uuid "eeb2f54f-b084-5556-a569-1423fbe14b78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5023974e-65e9-50b5-9103-6472584bc9df" :answer/id #uuid "5023974e-65e9-50b5-9103-6472584bc9df" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-88148730-01ef-5f8f-8698-d5c0f9002897" :answer/id #uuid "88148730-01ef-5f8f-8698-d5c0f9002897" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-4055ef63-afed-57cd-9e83-40b635766db8" :activity/id #uuid "4055ef63-afed-57cd-9e83-40b635766db8" :activity/title "Affine Transformations" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186049012 :activity/course 17592186046659 :activity/steps ["step-b807dd61-89c2-5db4-8943-bd74b3c1afcf" "step-cc4bf1be-e3d5-5c4b-a9a5-ed0868069153" "step-ac39a0c5-ad0c-5a77-bc83-5cd2051fe20d" "step-82f3d05a-839f-58f0-99f9-34effb6f6f37" "step-b6e583ee-ba67-5ed6-8db1-9